23
00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:24.000
and there was nothing there. You know, there was a, where they had pictures of the beautiful country club and the swimming pool. There was nothing there. There was just a sign. This is Rio Rancho Estates or something. So I started to look into this and I went to the county clerk's office and I saw the vast scope of this thing, that tens of thousands of people

